        rdfs:comment                   "Long strip of drawn-work with the Madonna and Child; a saint with a cross; a saint on horseback, possibly St. George with the dragon.  The Virgin (?) with crown and cross.  The angel of death with a scythe.  Symbols and the words \"Oratte, Frafii, and the letters F R\".  Tela tirata (Sicilian).  Francesca Amari, 1907."@en ;
